---
title: ManualRefund State Machine
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> PendingRefund : refund obligation created (approved FinancialAdjustment claim on a prepaid order)
    PendingRefund --> AwaitingVerification : Operator submits transfer evidence
    AwaitingVerification --> Refunded : Admin verifies evidence (submitter is not the verifier)
    AwaitingVerification --> PendingRefund : Admin rejects evidence (reason required, Operator resubmits)
    Refunded --> [*]
